<h1
  style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.3; color: #241f18;"
>
  Your password is changed
</h1>

<p
  style="margin: 0 0 24px 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4b463d;"
>
  Hi {{name}} — this is just the receipt. Your new
  password is active and every other device has been
  signed out.
</p>

<table
  role="presentation"
  width="100%"
  cellpadding="0"
  cellspacing="0"
  style="margin: 0 0 24px 0;"
>
  <tr>
    <td
      style="background-color: #e4eed4; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; color: #3f4a2a;"
    >
      <strong>When</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;{{changedAt}}<br />
      <strong>Where</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;{{requestContext}}
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
  <tr>
    <td
      style="background-color: #c1683c; border-radius: 999px;"
    >
      <a
        href="{{loginUrl}}"
        style="display: inline-block; padding: 14px 28px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none;"
        >Log in to Pawtato</a
      >
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<table
  role="presentation"
  width="100%"
  cellpadding="0"
  cellspacing="0"
  style="margin: 24px 0 0 0;"
>
  <tr>
    <td
      style="background-color: #fbe1d0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #7a3b22;"
    >
      Wasn't you? Reply to this email right away — we'll
      lock the account and keep your pets' pages online
      while we sort it out.
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p
  style="margin: 28px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #9c9284;"
>
  Pawtato · Dhanmondi, Dhaka ·
  <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}" style="color: #9c9284;"
    >{{supportEmail}}</a
  >
</p>
